# Lecture 6

### Media in Tutors

---

## Video Support

- YouTube embedded videos
- HEANet hosted videos
- Video chapters with start/end times
- Short bundled videos in labs

---

## Panel Videos

- Full screen width display
- Displayed directly on topic or unit
- Referenced via `videoid` file

---

## Summary

Tutors provides rich media integration, supporting videos from multiple providers alongside your course content.
